data: {"id": "225b798aed434641-thinking-parallel_evidence-4243", "run_id": "225b798aed434641", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_token", "tool_name": null, "content": "。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788416995567, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "225b798aed434641-thinking-parallel_evidence-4244", "run_id": "225b798aed434641", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n### 关键事实（来自真实工具结果）\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 处于 **Pending** 阶段，`ContainerCreating` 状态持续存在（17分钟以上，多次重试）。\n\n2. **根因事件**：kubelet 事件明确显示：\n   - `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n   - `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]`\n\n3. **卷配置**：Pod 声明了一个名为 `input` 的 ConfigMap 卷，引用 `unavailable-config`，且 `Optional: false`，意味着 ConfigMap 不存在时 Pod 无法调度。\n\n4. **观察维度结果**：\n   - **Logging** (`query_pod_logs`)", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788416995614, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "225b798aed434641-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "225b798aed434641", "seq": 4245, "ts_ms": 1788417004660, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 99.696, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/225b798aed434641-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "2be0d86f760616ed9199e9d96ad774a51f44e5d31f006c59fd7055708c23d5a9", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "d2a2c21d4f5c407df0083927977f5e898f1e733696ee8cdd88be03d63be5540c"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "225b798aed434641-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "225b798aed434641", "seq": 4246, "ts_ms": 1788417004661, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "225b798aed434641-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "225b798aed434641", "seq": 4247, "ts_ms": 1788417013260, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.599, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1736, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 持续处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，因挂载失败无法启动容器。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: Container (`app`) 状态为 `ContainerCreating` | 确证容器未启动，等待前置条件就绪 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `event.message` (x16): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接指出挂载失败及缺失依赖的具体资源名 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `event.message` (x7): `Unable to attach or mount volumes... timed out waiting for the condition` | 说明失败是持续阻塞，而非瞬时故障 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (Labels: `container=app`, `reason=ContainerCreating`) | 独立验证 Pod 持续处于等待容器创建的状态 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase`: `Pending`; `pod.status.phase`: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于集群调度完成但实际运行未启动的阶段 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.cpu`: `50m`; `container.resource_limit.memory`: `32Mi` | 提供资源配置上下文，排除资源超限导致的调度失败 |\n\n证据 2 与证据 4 相互印证：K8s Event 的 `FailedMount` 错误与 Prometheus Metric 中 `waiting_reason` 为 `ContainerCreating` 指向同一阻塞点，即卷挂载未完成阻止了容器运行。由于 Pod 始终处于 Pending 阶段，Logging 和 Tracing 数据无法采集。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在命名空间 aiops-case-03 中不存在 → 容器定义中非可选卷 'input' 挂载永久失败 → Kubelet 无法创建容器挂载点 → Pod 持续处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 的卷配置依赖 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该 ConfigMap 在当前命名空间中不存在。由于该卷配置为非可选（Optional: false），Kubelet 在挂载阶段持续报错（证据 2、3），导致容器无法初始化（证据 1、4），Pod 维持在 Pending 状态。\n\n证据编号：2, 3, 4, 5", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 持续处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，因挂载失败无法启动容器。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: Container (`app`) 状态为 `ContainerCreating` | 确证容器未启动，等待前置条件就绪 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `event.message` (x16): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接指出挂载失败及缺失依赖的具体资源名 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `event.message` (x7): `Unable to attach or mount volumes... timed out waiting for the condition` | 说明失败是持续阻塞，而非瞬时故障 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (Labels: `container=app`, `reason=ContainerCreating`) | 独立验证 Pod 持续处于等待容器创建的状态 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase`: `Pending`; `pod.status.phase`: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于集群调度完成但实际运行未启动的阶段 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.cpu`: `50m`; `container.resource_limit.memory`: `32Mi` | 提供资源配置上下文，排除资源超限导致的调度失败 |\n\n证据 2 与证据 4 相互印证：K8s Event 的 `FailedMount` 错误与 Prometheus Metric 中 `waiting_reason` 为 `ContainerCreating` 指向同一阻塞点，即卷挂载未完成阻止了容器运行。由于 Pod 始终处于 Pending 阶段，Logging 和 Tracing 数据无法采集。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在命名空间 aiops-case-03 中不存在 → 容器定义中非可选卷 'input' 挂载永久失败 → Kubelet 无法创建容器挂载点 → Pod 持续处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 的卷配置依赖 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该 ConfigMap 在当前命名空间中不存在。由于该卷配置为非可选（Optional: false），Kubelet 在挂载阶段持续报错（证据 2、3），导致容器无法初始化（证据 1、4），Pod 维持在 Pending 状态。\n\n证据编号：2, 3, 4, 5"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "225b798aed434641-final", "run_id": "225b798aed434641", "seq": 4249, "ts_ms": 1788417013275, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 持续处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，因挂载失败无法启动容器。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: Container (`app`) 状态为 `ContainerCreating` | 确证容器未启动，等待前置条件就绪 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `event.message` (x16): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接指出挂载失败及缺失依赖的具体资源名 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `event.message` (x7): `Unable to attach or mount volumes... timed out waiting for the condition` | 说明失败是持续阻塞，而非瞬时故障 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (Labels: `container=app`, `reason=ContainerCreating`) | 独立验证 Pod 持续处于等待容器创建的状态 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase`: `Pending`; `pod.status.phase`: `Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于集群调度完成但实际运行未启动的阶段 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.cpu`: `50m`; `container.resource_limit.memory`: `32Mi` | 提供资源配置上下文，排除资源超限导致的调度失败 |\n\n证据 2 与证据 4 相互印证：K8s Event 的 `FailedMount` 错误与 Prometheus Metric 中 `waiting_reason` 为 `ContainerCreating` 指向同一阻塞点，即卷挂载未完成阻止了容器运行。由于 Pod 始终处于 Pending 阶段，Logging 和 Tracing 数据无法采集。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在命名空间 aiops-case-03 中不存在 → 容器定义中非可选卷 'input' 挂载永久失败 → Kubelet 无法创建容器挂载点 → Pod 持续处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 的卷配置依赖 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该 ConfigMap 在当前命名空间中不存在。由于该卷配置为非可选（Optional: false），Kubelet 在挂载阶段持续报错（证据 2、3），导致容器无法初始化（证据 1、4），Pod 维持在 Pending 状态。\n\n证据编号：2, 3, 4, 5\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 35.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 99.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 99.7s (Evidence 90.7s, RCA 8.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 143.502, "metrics": {"run_id": "225b798aed434641", "mttr": {"value": "2.4m", "seconds": 143.5055410861969, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "47%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 143505.5410861969, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 117899.83558654785, "tool_calls": 21, "executed_tool_calls": 18, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 21, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 32954.57911491394, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 25108.680486679077}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 35186.8691444397, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 99695.99509239197, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8599.342107772827, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

